<title>USA: Questar International acquires Histotec.</title>
<headline>Questar International acquires Histotec.</headline>
<dateline>GRAIN VALLEY, Mo. 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Questar International Inc said Wednesday it acquired all 200,000 outstanding shares of Histotec of Iowa Inc, a human DNA extraction and storage company.</p>
<p>Histotec will become a wholly owned subsidiary of Questar.</p>
<p>Shares were exchanged on May 27 at a ratio of 10 Questar shares per Histotec share. The company said Histotec holders were issued two million shares of Questar stock.</p>
<p>Directors of Histotec will continue to serve in their present positions, Questar said.</p>
<p>Questar shares closed up 0.18 at 0.38.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
